    <section class="ve-process-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="ve-section-header text-center">
                <span class="ve-section-tag">How It Works</span>
                <h2>Getting Help is <span>Simple</span></h2>
            </div>

            <div class="ve-process-grid">

                <!-- Step 01 -->
                <div class="ve-process-step wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="100ms">
                    <div class="ve-process-num">01</div>
                    <h5>Create Your Account</h5>
                    <p>
                        Register on Abhaya and add your basic information and
                        trusted emergency contacts for quick assistance.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="ve-process-arrow">
                    <i class="fa fa-long-arrow-right"></i>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 02 -->
                <div class="ve-process-step wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="250ms">
                    <div class="ve-process-num">02</div>
                    <h5>Set Up Your Safety</h5>
                    <p>
                        Add trusted contacts and configure your safety preferences
                        so help can reach you when you need it.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="ve-process-arrow">
                    <i class="fa fa-long-arrow-right"></i>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 03 -->
                <div class="ve-process-step wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="400ms">
                    <div class="ve-process-num">03</div>
                    <h5>Send an SOS</h5>
                    <p>
                        In an emergency, activate the SOS feature to quickly
                        share your alert and location with your trusted contacts.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="ve-process-arrow">
                    <i class="fa fa-long-arrow-right"></i>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 04 -->
                <div class="ve-process-step wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="550ms">
                    <div class="ve-process-num">04</div>
                    <h5>Receive Support</h5>
                    <p>
                        Stay connected with your trusted contacts and emergency
                        support while your situation is being handled.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ve-section ve-faq-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-start">

                <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 wow fadeInLeft" data-wow-delay="100ms">
                    <span class="ve-section-tag">Common Questions</span>

                    <h2>Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span></h2>

                    <p>
                        Have questions about Abhaya or its safety features?
                        <a href="/contact/support" style="color:var(--ve-gold);">
                            Reach out to us
                        </a>
                        and our team will be happy to help.
                    </p>

                    <a href="/contact/support" class="ve-btn-primary mt-30">
                        Contact Our Team
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 wow fadeInRight" data-wow-delay="200ms">

                    <div class="ve-faq-list">

                        <!-- FAQ 1 -->
                        <div class="ve-faq-item open">
                            <div class="ve-faq-q">
                                <span>What is Abhaya?</span>
                                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div class="ve-faq-a ps-4 pe-4">
                                Abhaya is a women safety platform designed
                                to provide emergency assistance, SOS alerts, live
                                location sharing, incident reporting, and trusted
                                contact support.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- FAQ 2 -->
                        <div class="ve-faq-item">
                            <div class="ve-faq-q">
                                <span>How does the SOS feature work?</span>
                                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div class="ve-faq-a">
                                When you activate the SOS feature, Abhaya creates
                                an emergency alert and can share your current
                                location with your configured emergency contacts
                                so they can respond quickly.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- FAQ 3 -->
                        <div class="ve-faq-item">
                            <div class="ve-faq-q">
                                <span>Can I share my live location?</span>
                                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div class="ve-faq-a">
                                Yes. Abhaya allows users to share their location
                                with trusted contacts, helping them stay connected
                                and making it easier to provide assistance during
                                an emergency.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- FAQ 4 -->
                        <div class="ve-faq-item">
                            <div class="ve-faq-q">
                                <span>Can I report a safety incident?</span>
                                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div class="ve-faq-a">
                                Yes. Users can report incidents such as harassment,
                                stalking, threats, domestic violence, cybercrime,
                                and other safety concerns through the incident
                                reporting system.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- FAQ 6 -->
                        <div class="ve-faq-item">
                            <div class="ve-faq-q">
                                <span>How can I add emergency contacts?</span>
                                <i class="fa fa-plus"></i>
                            </div>

                            <div class="ve-faq-a">
                                After registering, you can add trusted family
                                members, friends, guardians, or other trusted
                                contacts who can be notified during an emergency.
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

